# 0 SECTION; code pages (ANSI_1251, ANSI_1252, UTF-8 from AC1021, a multi-byte page without a table), \U+XXXX, TEXT's %%
# codes, MTEXT's format codes, the colour index, font substitutes, linetype patterns; the mapping per kind, the extents,
# the runs of layers, groups, set_layer_visible; a binary DXF, not a DXF, a broken group code, a cut file, a long line,
# limits, counts that lie, 600 randomly damaged files; the GPU against the CPU path on two drawings
